# The Abyss Expedition - a world plan of the library: an expedition downwards
# A free-form adventure beside Raft's story: each island leads deeper - an old mine, a buried shelter, a sunken island,
# the caverns under a mountain, a wreck, a drowned city - and at the end the Abyss, a trench where something old lives
# in the dark. Each island comes when the quest of the one before is done, near it (the generated ones - a sunken
# island and a wreck - are new in every world).
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe plan_abyss) in the editor's World plans window. Its play test:
# content\tests\plan_abyss.play.
plan new The Abyss Expedition
plan description An expedition downwards beside Raft's story: an old mine, a buried shelter, a sunken island, caverns, a wreck and a drowned city - each found when the one before is done - and at the end the Abyss, a trench where something old lives in the dark.
plan random off
plan story on
plan rule mine | island:Old Mine Islet | start | ahead:400 | A headframe over an old shaft on the islet ahead. The expedition starts here. | Old Mine Islet
plan rule shelter | island:Shelter Atoll | quest:mine | near:mine:700:east | The miner's map marks a shelter under an atoll to the east. | Shelter Atoll
plan rule sunken | type:sunken | quest:shelter | near:shelter:600:south-east | The shelter's charts show an island under the sea to the south-east. Dive! | Sunken island
plan rule caverns | island:Ironreef Caverns | visit:sunken | near:sunken:800:east | From the sunken island's peak: a mountain to the east, full of caves. | Ironreef Caverns
plan rule wreck | type:wreck | quest:caverns | near:caverns:600:south | Something floats south of the mountain: a wreck. | Wreck
plan rule city | island:The Drowned Metropolis | visit:wreck | near:wreck:800:east | The wreck's log: "Meridian, east. Don't go down to the foundations." | Drowned Metropolis
plan rule abyss | island:The Abyss | quest:city | near:city:900:south | The Lantern Lord's lair opened onto a trench to the south. The Abyss. | The Abyss
plan save
